WEBVTT

00:14.083 --> 00:18.750
[man] Tell me,
are you being oppressed right now?

00:19.375 --> 00:23.625
Bullying at school, harassed at work,

00:24.208 --> 00:27.916
suffering unjust torment
that drives you to the edge?

00:28.708 --> 00:32.208
Do you want to become stronger?

00:33.583 --> 00:39.083
Become stronger,
and you can change your world.

00:41.125 --> 00:43.458
[birdsong]

00:45.583 --> 00:47.166
[alarm buzzing, ringing]

00:52.958 --> 00:54.041
[moans]

01:01.083 --> 01:02.208
[sneezes]

01:02.291 --> 01:04.750
BEWARE OF FRAUDULENT CHARGES!

01:06.458 --> 01:07.708
[sniffs]

01:09.250 --> 01:10.208
Mm.

01:12.458 --> 01:13.875
SAVE ELECTRICITY

01:22.375 --> 01:25.208
MOM

01:25.291 --> 01:27.500
[coins jangling]

01:33.375 --> 01:36.750
[mom] Good morning.
It's time for you to get going soon.

01:36.833 --> 01:38.666
Have fun at school today!

01:41.041 --> 01:43.291
THANKS, I WILL.

01:48.083 --> 01:49.208
SHIMURA

01:49.291 --> 01:52.000
[jaunty pop music playing]

01:52.083 --> 01:53.166
LIVE STREAM?

01:53.250 --> 01:54.208
AT LAST!

01:54.291 --> 01:55.125
WHEN?

01:55.208 --> 01:56.125
CAN'T WAIT!!!

01:56.625 --> 01:57.458
SO EXCITED!

01:57.541 --> 01:59.166
IS IT STARTING SOON?

01:59.250 --> 02:01.833
[messages popping]

02:03.375 --> 02:04.375
♪ Yo… ♪

02:04.458 --> 02:07.916
Allow me to introduce myself. I'm Hamaken.

02:08.000 --> 02:12.541
Today, we're celebrating reaching
more than 700,000 subscribers.

02:12.625 --> 02:16.625
And today you're going to meet someone
who's been trending wildly on Instagram.

02:16.708 --> 02:20.000
And here she is now,
the beautiful influencer Rumi, everyone!

02:20.083 --> 02:23.208
-[all cheering, whooping]
-Hi! Rumi, here.

02:23.291 --> 02:26.041
I'm just new to Instagram,
so if you could please like and subscribe.

02:26.125 --> 02:28.541
So, Rumi, what do you have
in store for us today?

02:28.625 --> 02:31.041
Yeah! Well, in today's makeup tutorial,

02:31.125 --> 02:33.750
we're going to give
a guy in my class a makeover!

02:33.833 --> 02:35.708
[all whooping]

02:35.791 --> 02:38.708
And right now,
I'll introduce today's model.

02:38.791 --> 02:40.125
[whispers] Just over here.

02:40.958 --> 02:43.125
-[girl 1] Huh?
-[girl 2] Yeah. I wonder who it is.

02:43.208 --> 02:45.416
-This is Shimura! Okay?
-[girl 2] Shimura?

02:45.500 --> 02:47.125
-Yay!
-[boy] Seriously?

02:47.208 --> 02:49.208
You're on camera. Smile for us.

02:49.291 --> 02:50.208
-And… cut!
-♪ Yo… ♪

02:50.291 --> 02:52.750
[rock music playing]

02:52.833 --> 02:54.166
Hey, Shimura.

02:54.250 --> 02:56.625
Try to look like you're having fun, okay?

02:56.708 --> 02:57.708
Sorry.

02:57.791 --> 02:59.875
It's worth 1,000 yen to you.

03:00.375 --> 03:01.708
You think this is a joke, huh?

03:01.791 --> 03:03.125
This punk thinks we're joking?

03:03.208 --> 03:05.750
-[boy 3] You messing with us?
-Hey, hold still.

03:07.541 --> 03:09.833
[students chattering, laughing]

03:09.916 --> 03:12.083
[Shimura] This is my "fun" school life.

03:12.791 --> 03:13.833
♪ Yo… ♪

03:13.916 --> 03:17.166
Hi, time to check out the big reveal!

03:17.666 --> 03:20.291
[students laughing]

03:20.375 --> 03:21.291
♪ Yo… ♪

03:23.833 --> 03:26.250
Come on, guys. This is too much.
Don't you think?

03:26.333 --> 03:27.708
What? You don't like it?

03:27.791 --> 03:31.083
Aw! Have we taken things too far? Have we?

03:31.166 --> 03:34.000
-[boy 4] This doesn't look cool.
-[Shimura] I laugh at things.

03:34.083 --> 03:36.750
I laugh at things
I don't find funny at all.

03:36.833 --> 03:39.750
Nod along to things I don't agree with.

03:40.458 --> 03:41.458
But I'm fine with it.

03:41.541 --> 03:44.291
-Those big black circles like a panda…
-This is how it is.

03:44.375 --> 03:47.958
Shimura! Say hello again
to all the viewers who are watching now.

03:48.916 --> 03:52.375
Hi, guys. I'm Kota Shimura.

03:52.958 --> 03:54.958
[students cheering mockingly]

03:55.041 --> 03:56.500
[tense music playing]

03:56.583 --> 03:58.125
And I just take it.

04:00.791 --> 04:02.375
[music swells, then fades]

04:04.166 --> 04:06.583
I can't get it off.

04:07.791 --> 04:10.041
[Shimura] What do I have to offer anyway?

04:11.000 --> 04:13.125
He may suck at studying,
but he's got a talent

04:13.208 --> 04:14.708
for making money through streaming.

04:14.791 --> 04:17.125
Hey, we've made 50,000 yen already.

04:17.500 --> 04:19.541
-Whoa!
-[Rumi] Oh? Oh.

04:19.625 --> 04:22.208
-Hey, hey, hey, Hamaken.
-Hamaken's amazing, no doubt.

04:22.291 --> 04:24.791
[Shimura] She has the talent to get by
with her good looks alone.

04:24.875 --> 04:26.958
That's all right. You can have his share.

04:27.041 --> 04:28.583
-Huh?!
-Yeah?

04:28.666 --> 04:31.000
Oh, yeah. Sure. It's yours.

04:31.083 --> 04:32.708
-Ah, thank you!
-Sure.

04:32.791 --> 04:36.208
[Shimura] And this guy knows how to
brownnose his way up the social ladder.

04:37.666 --> 04:40.416
But me? I have nothing.

04:41.375 --> 04:44.500
I'm at the very bottom
of the school's social ladder.

04:45.166 --> 04:46.583
-[coin jangles]
-Oh!

04:52.166 --> 04:55.250
Look at you.
Desperate for a measly 10 yen, hey?

04:55.333 --> 04:56.958
I guess being poor sucks!

04:57.041 --> 04:58.083
[Hamaken and Rumi laugh]

04:58.166 --> 05:00.541
[ominous music playing]

05:00.625 --> 05:03.208
Uh… um, where's my 1,000 yen?

05:03.291 --> 05:04.166
What?

05:04.791 --> 05:07.875
You said I'd get
a thousand yen for the makeover.

05:07.958 --> 05:09.333
Did I say that? Really?

05:09.416 --> 05:10.875
[Yumi laughs] I don't remember.

05:10.958 --> 05:12.750
[singsong] I don't recall that!

05:12.833 --> 05:13.666
[all laugh]

05:13.750 --> 05:15.791
-But I only agreed because you--
-[grunts]

05:15.875 --> 05:17.625
[groaning] Ugh!

05:17.708 --> 05:19.458
-[wincing] Agh!
-[Hamaken] Shut up, loser.

05:19.541 --> 05:22.375
Just a thousand yen. Why so desperate?

05:22.458 --> 05:23.750
Oh, I know.

05:24.208 --> 05:27.875
It's your mom, isn't it?
She's still alive, is she?

05:28.541 --> 05:32.500
Oh, I forgot she's sick!
Oh! That's why you're so poor!

05:32.583 --> 05:34.208
-Is that what it is?
-[all laughing]

05:34.291 --> 05:36.041
-[boy 1] Hey!
-[Hamaken] Hey, let's go.

05:36.125 --> 05:38.458
[boy 2 laughs] That was so mean!

05:38.541 --> 05:40.541
[boy 1] Yeah. He'll do anything for money.

05:52.666 --> 05:53.833
[Shimura] I should have…

05:56.875 --> 06:00.166
I should have taken a swing at them
and fought back.

06:01.291 --> 06:03.041
-[sniffles]
-[music fades]

06:03.125 --> 06:05.416
URABE GENERAL HOSPITAL

06:05.500 --> 06:07.791
-[mom] What happened to your face?
-Huh?

06:07.875 --> 06:10.083
Oh, you weren't fighting
with anyone, were you?

06:10.750 --> 06:13.250
No. I would never do that.

06:13.333 --> 06:16.166
-I just tripped, that's all.
-Really? That's okay then.

06:16.250 --> 06:18.250
I got you a rice cake. [giggles]

06:21.625 --> 06:23.875
TOTAL AMOUNT DUE: 3,140,000 YEN

06:23.958 --> 06:25.125
How's school going?

06:25.208 --> 06:27.125
[poignant music playing]

06:27.208 --> 06:29.250
Mm. It's okay. [chuckles]

06:29.791 --> 06:32.333
Good. Well, don't worry about me.

06:32.416 --> 06:34.791
Just enjoy your high school life.

06:35.791 --> 06:37.541
'Cause you are…

06:38.708 --> 06:40.250
only young once.

06:44.000 --> 06:46.833
AMERICAN HOUSE DINER

06:46.916 --> 06:48.708
[rock music playing over speakers]

06:53.291 --> 06:55.583
-[fryer sizzling]
-[Shimura] This is my youth.

06:56.208 --> 06:58.375
I spend my days frying potatoes here.

06:58.458 --> 07:00.375
[man] Shimura, hurry up with order 60.

07:00.458 --> 07:01.291
Uh, yes, sir.

07:03.916 --> 07:04.791
Here.

07:04.875 --> 07:08.208
My life is… so shit.

07:09.375 --> 07:11.416
Can I have everyone's attention, please?

07:11.500 --> 07:13.666
Please, say hello to our newest employee.

07:13.750 --> 07:16.333
Oh man, like we're not slammed.

07:17.958 --> 07:18.958
Nice to meet you.

07:19.041 --> 07:22.083
[bubbly romantic music playing]

07:22.166 --> 07:24.208
I'm Kaho Asamiya.

07:25.375 --> 07:28.083
Okay, maybe it's not so shit.

07:28.166 --> 07:29.583
Nice to be working here.

07:29.666 --> 07:31.583
If you have any questions,
just ask any of us.

07:31.666 --> 07:32.750
[Kaho] I will.

07:34.166 --> 07:35.375
[timer beeping]

07:35.458 --> 07:37.416
-Ah! It's hot!
-[sizzling]

07:37.500 --> 07:41.083
Crap! I stared too long.
She must think that I'm a creep.

07:43.166 --> 07:44.791
-Bacon cheeseburger combo.
-Yes!

07:44.875 --> 07:46.375
[Kaho] Great, coming right up.

07:47.541 --> 07:49.500
Shimura, what are you doing?
You've got an order.

07:49.583 --> 07:50.750
Yes, sir.5

07:50.833 --> 07:51.750
[entry bell jingles]

07:51.833 --> 07:54.083
Hello, everyone!
I'm Hamaken, the streamer.

07:54.166 --> 07:57.416
-Hamaken? What are they doing here?
-With 700,000 subscribers.

07:57.500 --> 07:59.500
-[Hamaken] Streaming from a burger joint.
-Oh, crap.

07:59.583 --> 08:01.333
[boy 1] Hey, hey, hey, guys!

08:01.416 --> 08:03.833
All right, here's today's mission
from our viewers.

08:03.916 --> 08:04.750
Ta-da!

08:04.833 --> 08:07.875
Can they make a cheeseburger
like this one in under 30 seconds?!

08:07.958 --> 08:09.125
-Yeah!
-Yeah!

08:09.208 --> 08:11.625
And if they fail this important challenge,

08:11.708 --> 08:15.875
then, uh… this cute little waitress
has no choice but to give us her number.

08:15.958 --> 08:19.500
You're bothering the other customers.
I think you should stop doing this.

08:19.583 --> 08:22.791
I apologize. I'm not all for it either,
but it's my viewers.

08:22.875 --> 08:24.083
They keep egging me on.

08:24.166 --> 08:25.875
-Thanks for your cooperation!
-Thank you!

08:25.958 --> 08:28.875
-I'm sorry, we can't do this.
-Okay, start the clock!

08:28.958 --> 08:29.833
-Huh?
-One.

08:29.916 --> 08:32.875
-[Kaho] Wait.
-[Hamaken, boys] Two, three, four, five.

08:32.958 --> 08:36.041
-Six, seven, eight, nine, ten.…
-What should we do about this?

08:36.125 --> 08:37.416
Uh, what do you mean "we"?

08:37.500 --> 08:39.125
-Where's the boss?
-He stepped out.

08:39.208 --> 08:41.541
They're banned
from filming here without access.

08:41.625 --> 08:42.500
-Stop them.
-Me?!

08:42.583 --> 08:44.750
-[boys] …21, 22, 23, 24…
-Oh, okay.

08:44.833 --> 08:47.916
-…25, 26, 27, 28…
-Sir, the manager, he's not here just now.

08:48.000 --> 08:50.166
Sorry for the wait.
Here's your Monster Cheeseburger.

08:54.666 --> 08:56.041
You…

08:58.791 --> 09:00.750
-[Hamaken] Let's go.
-[boy 1] Let's get outta here.

09:02.041 --> 09:05.916
-[music playing faintly over speakers]
-[entry bell jingles]

09:06.000 --> 09:07.208
Didn't see me.

09:07.291 --> 09:09.291
[sighs] Oh, thank goodness.

09:10.250 --> 09:11.916
[sighs deeply]

09:12.000 --> 09:13.958
Oh, thank you, Shimura.

09:14.833 --> 09:17.041
Uh… uh, how do you know my name?

09:17.916 --> 09:18.750
[laughs] That.

09:18.833 --> 09:20.458
SHIMURA

09:20.541 --> 09:22.541
Yeah. Uh, of course.

09:22.625 --> 09:24.875
[Shimura] Oh, crap.
I'm being creepy again.

09:24.958 --> 09:26.041
[giggles]

09:29.708 --> 09:30.583
But…

09:30.666 --> 09:31.708
I'm terribly sorry.

09:31.791 --> 09:34.250
-She thanked me.
-Terribly sorry.

09:34.833 --> 09:36.708
So sorry for all the trouble.

09:37.708 --> 09:39.083
Please enjoy your meals.

09:39.166 --> 09:41.208
[humming]

09:41.291 --> 09:43.416
[gasps] She said, "Thank you."

09:43.500 --> 09:47.041
[continues humming]

09:47.125 --> 09:48.916
It's Shimura.

09:49.000 --> 09:50.000
[tense music playing]

09:50.083 --> 09:52.416
Bastard. Why'd you get in my way?

09:53.041 --> 09:53.875
-Huh?
-[groans]

09:53.958 --> 09:56.750
-[whimpering]
-Huh? Huh? Huh? Huh?

09:56.833 --> 09:58.083
-[blows thudding]
-[yelps] Oh!

09:58.166 --> 09:59.833
-Huh?
-I'm sorry.

09:59.916 --> 10:01.958
Sorry isn't gonna cut it.

10:02.541 --> 10:03.541
[grunts]

10:04.625 --> 10:08.666
Hey, you ruined my content, you did.

10:08.750 --> 10:09.958
"Your" content?

10:10.875 --> 10:14.416
Don't you dare interfere
with Hamaken's content?

10:14.500 --> 10:16.375
-[kick thuds]
-[Kaho] Shimura?

10:17.250 --> 10:18.500
[Hamaken] Hey! Are you okay?

10:18.583 --> 10:20.583
-[laughing]
-[Hamaken] Careful. Let me help you.

10:20.666 --> 10:22.333
-There.
-Shimura.

10:22.416 --> 10:23.791
[Hamaken] Well, then.

10:23.875 --> 10:26.041
Good luck with work.

10:26.125 --> 10:27.041
[Shimura gulps]

10:29.750 --> 10:31.708
-[whimpers]
-Enjoy your shift.

10:33.666 --> 10:35.083
[door closes]

10:35.166 --> 10:36.708
Hey, you okay?

10:36.791 --> 10:38.166
[Shimura] Uh, sure.

10:39.333 --> 10:41.333
Uh… oh, them there?

10:41.416 --> 10:44.208
No, it's nothing at all, really.
I just fell. That's all.

10:44.875 --> 10:47.125
Uh, those guys, they're in my class.

10:47.208 --> 10:48.375
We're friends.

10:50.125 --> 10:54.375
Lame. It's so obvious we're not friends.

10:54.458 --> 10:55.541
[door opens]

10:55.625 --> 10:56.791
[phone buzzes]

10:56.875 --> 10:58.041
[door closes]

10:59.416 --> 11:01.500
WHAT TIME WILL YOU BE HOME TODAY?

11:04.083 --> 11:06.458
I HAVE SELF-STUDY. I'LL BE LATE.

11:10.958 --> 11:13.208
[game controller tapping]

11:16.666 --> 11:19.000
[video game explosions]

11:22.416 --> 11:24.625
[Yumi] Huh? What's your problem?

11:24.708 --> 11:28.500
I don't have a problem.
This seat here is mine. So, please move.

11:28.583 --> 11:31.375
[girl 1] She's so full of herself.

11:32.833 --> 11:35.958
-You're coming with me.
-Let me go! [grunts]

11:36.041 --> 11:37.333
[gasps]

11:38.916 --> 11:42.083
[tense music playing]

11:48.458 --> 11:49.791
[game creature screeches]

11:51.375 --> 11:55.083
-What a rough morning.
-Hey, little girl boss is strong.

11:55.166 --> 11:56.458
[Yumi] You're doing so well.

11:56.541 --> 11:58.291
[girl 2] Oh, I wonder who did it.

12:02.583 --> 12:05.000
-You piss me off.
-[girl 1] Oh, yeah.

12:05.083 --> 12:06.666
[girl 1] Gloomy-ass bitch.

12:07.291 --> 12:09.666
[girls laughing]

12:15.166 --> 12:17.166
SCHOOL MOTTO
LET YOUR DREAMS SHINE

12:23.541 --> 12:26.125
[music intensifies]

12:30.291 --> 12:31.125
[music fades]

12:31.916 --> 12:33.750
MISSION FAILED

12:35.750 --> 12:37.083
[game controller clatters]

12:41.916 --> 12:44.500
-[raucous dance music playing]
-[all] Oh!

12:52.333 --> 12:54.250
[all cheering] Yeah!

12:56.416 --> 12:59.541
Bottoms up. Have some more. Here you go.

13:00.833 --> 13:02.333
[girl 1] Whoa! Cocky bitch.

13:02.416 --> 13:05.000
Hey! Was this really just for content?

13:05.083 --> 13:06.041
Hmm?

13:06.125 --> 13:07.750
[Yumi] You weren't trying
to get a number?

13:07.833 --> 13:08.666
DESPERATE FOR HER NUMBER

13:08.750 --> 13:10.333
Of course not.

13:11.833 --> 13:13.875
Hmm. That's what I thought.

13:15.208 --> 13:18.125
[sighs] I don't want you texting
other girls, okay?

13:18.208 --> 13:21.291
Dummy. You're the only one for me.

13:23.916 --> 13:26.833
-[music stops]
-[snack back crinkles]

13:26.916 --> 13:28.000
DANDAN NOODLES

13:28.083 --> 13:30.750
[boy] Whoa! Too close! Too close! Whoa!

13:32.416 --> 13:34.666
-Hell yeah!
-[Shimura] Why is this happening?

13:34.750 --> 13:38.375
[boy] Ah! Too bad.
Thanks for your 3,000 yen donation!

13:39.791 --> 13:44.375
What? Complete the next hunt
in under three minutes for 30,000 yen?

13:44.458 --> 13:47.291
Are you sure?
That's a piece of cake for me.

13:47.875 --> 13:48.708
[laughs]

13:48.791 --> 13:49.625
[mouthing]

13:49.708 --> 13:51.791
Uh, sorry, almost done.

13:53.625 --> 13:58.250
All the viewers saying I can't do it.
If I succeed, you'd better donate a lot.

13:58.958 --> 14:00.291
All right, here I go.

14:00.958 --> 14:01.791
Very nice.

14:01.875 --> 14:03.833
-Why?
-[boy] All right. All right.

14:03.916 --> 14:06.000
Why did I let him into my house?

14:11.125 --> 14:14.625
I figured I'd open my own channel
and rake in all the donations.

14:16.416 --> 14:17.666
But you know what?

14:18.166 --> 14:20.291
It's hard for minors to open a channel.

14:20.375 --> 14:23.375
You need your parent's bank account
and other stuff like that.

14:24.041 --> 14:27.416
-Ah, I see.
-Your mom's in hospital. Isn't that right?

14:28.666 --> 14:30.666
Mm. Ah! [gasping]

14:30.750 --> 14:32.583
You know what I mean?

14:33.083 --> 14:37.708
[Shimura] He's making money using
my mom's ID and bank account details.

14:37.791 --> 14:38.875
[boy] Oh, here we go!

14:38.958 --> 14:40.666
[Shimura] Mom, I'm really sorry.

14:40.750 --> 14:42.250
[boy] Yes! Yes, yes!

14:42.333 --> 14:46.375
Oh, I'm so close
to the 30,000 yen! Yes! Oh!

14:46.458 --> 14:48.375
One last hit! Here we go!

14:48.458 --> 14:51.916
Three, two, one…

14:52.000 --> 14:54.375
-[loud click echoes]
-[electricity crackles]

14:54.458 --> 14:56.416
-[low bass rumbles]
-[no audible dialogue]

15:04.958 --> 15:07.333
-[screams] Ah! It's hot! Ah! Ah!
-[rock music playing]

15:07.416 --> 15:09.583
Oh! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

15:09.666 --> 15:11.416
[gasping, whimpering]

15:12.000 --> 15:14.333
[gasping]

15:15.541 --> 15:16.625
[huffs]

15:17.250 --> 15:20.000
-What the hell have you done?
-Ah!

15:20.833 --> 15:22.000
-[whimpering]
-[grunting]

15:22.083 --> 15:23.500
I said I'm sorry!

15:23.583 --> 15:26.250
-I was one strike away from 30,000 yen!
-I'm sorry!

15:26.333 --> 15:28.541
How are you gonna make up for this?!
You'd better pay up!

15:28.625 --> 15:31.375
-[whimpering]
-That's right! You owe me now!

15:31.458 --> 15:33.583
[Shimura] I can't
just come up with 30,000 yen!

15:33.666 --> 15:34.833
[clattering]

15:34.916 --> 15:37.666
-Don't run away, you bastard!
-[screaming]

15:37.750 --> 15:39.833
[Shimura gasping]

15:39.916 --> 15:42.500
You're too poor, aren't you? [snarls]

15:42.583 --> 15:44.000
[Shimura gasping] Ow!

15:44.916 --> 15:45.791
[yells] Ah!

15:45.875 --> 15:47.833
[panting]

15:47.916 --> 15:48.791
[tapping keyboard]

15:48.875 --> 15:50.000
[Shimura] How pathetic.

15:50.083 --> 15:52.833
Why do I have to get beaten up
in my own home?

15:52.916 --> 15:54.916
Ah, damn it! Damn it!

15:55.000 --> 15:58.833
You're a useless piece of shit!

15:58.916 --> 16:01.250
-[grunting]
-[yelping]

16:01.333 --> 16:02.958
-[boy snarling]
-[Shimura grunts]

16:03.750 --> 16:04.625
[whimpers]

16:04.708 --> 16:08.958
Your mom is gonna die
because you're useless shit!

16:09.041 --> 16:10.833
[tense music playing]

16:10.916 --> 16:12.375
[laughs]

16:17.708 --> 16:20.041
[Shimura straining]

16:25.083 --> 16:27.541
What are you holding onto me for?

16:27.625 --> 16:29.833
What the hell are you doing? Let me go!

16:29.916 --> 16:31.583
[straining]

16:31.666 --> 16:33.166
[grunting]

16:33.250 --> 16:34.833
[roaring]

16:37.791 --> 16:40.041
[Shimura] The first fist I ever raised.

16:40.125 --> 16:42.083
The first person I ever hit.

16:42.166 --> 16:43.541
-[yells] Ah!
-[boy groans]

16:43.625 --> 16:46.583
[boy] Stop it! The hell's wrong with you?

16:48.333 --> 16:51.083
[Shimura] And the first fist in my face.

16:52.208 --> 16:53.333
You've got some nerve!

16:53.416 --> 16:54.625
[Shimura roars]

16:56.041 --> 16:57.250
[grunting]

16:57.333 --> 16:58.166
[voices muted]

16:58.250 --> 17:03.041
[Shimura] Fighting turned out...
to not be as big a deal as I thought.

17:15.458 --> 17:17.625
Ah! It's… sore.

17:20.541 --> 17:21.416
[sighs]

17:26.333 --> 17:27.916
What a mess.

17:29.208 --> 17:30.958
I've gotta clean.

17:32.083 --> 17:34.583
[groaning]

17:36.500 --> 17:37.875
Ah! Gotta save power.

17:40.500 --> 17:42.125
[sighs]

18:04.875 --> 18:06.416
Immunotherapy?

18:06.500 --> 18:07.541
[man] That's correct.

18:08.041 --> 18:11.041
Keytruda is a very promising drug.

18:11.125 --> 18:14.541
I suggested it to your mother,
but she declined.

18:17.125 --> 18:19.958
[woman] Your mother always brags
about you, Shimura.

18:20.583 --> 18:24.083
She says you're a sweet boy
who's never gotten in a fight.

18:29.916 --> 18:31.500
Let me think about this.

18:32.000 --> 18:33.458
[man] Yes, of course.

18:36.291 --> 18:39.458
[train clacking]

18:40.041 --> 18:41.291
[Shimura] That's what I said.

18:42.375 --> 18:43.625
But what am I gonna do?

18:43.708 --> 18:47.958
[phone ringing]

18:49.166 --> 18:50.125
[ringing stops]

18:51.000 --> 18:52.083
Hello?

18:52.166 --> 18:53.708
[boy] Where the hell are you?

18:53.791 --> 18:54.625
What?

18:54.708 --> 18:57.250
-[suspenseful music playing]
-The video! Delete it!

18:57.750 --> 18:58.708
What video?

18:58.791 --> 19:03.041
The live stream from yesterday,
it's been uploaded!

19:03.125 --> 19:05.458
Huh? Oh. Well, I… I…

19:05.541 --> 19:07.333
But… I thought I pulled the plug out.

19:09.375 --> 19:11.125
Was that the monitor's power?

19:11.208 --> 19:12.750
So the computer was still on?

19:12.833 --> 19:14.416
The whole fight! The whole goddamn thing!

19:14.500 --> 19:18.500
Now everyone can see everything!
It was all streamed from the webcam.

19:18.833 --> 19:19.916
LIVE FIGHT LOL

19:20.000 --> 19:21.416
BOTH OF THEM SUCK

19:21.500 --> 19:22.833
I'M CRYING! ROFLMAO

19:26.166 --> 19:28.791
[Shimura] It's got over 100,000 views.

19:29.375 --> 19:31.750
Well, wait a minute. I never uploaded it.

19:31.833 --> 19:34.750
Then you must have
turned off the computer.

19:34.833 --> 19:37.166
[Shimura] Ah! Gotta save power.

19:38.791 --> 19:39.666
Oh.

19:39.750 --> 19:43.708
The video automatically uploads
when the computer is turned off midstream!

19:43.791 --> 19:45.500
[music winds down]

19:46.166 --> 19:48.500
[suspenseful music playing]

19:55.250 --> 19:57.291
[huffing]

20:02.000 --> 20:04.208
KANEGON'S GAME STREAM, 130K VIEWS

20:04.291 --> 20:06.583
What do I do? How do I delete it?

20:12.666 --> 20:14.083
NO VIDEOS UPLOADED

20:14.166 --> 20:15.125
[exhales]

20:16.500 --> 20:18.791
-[gasping]
-[music ends]

20:20.125 --> 20:22.625
HIGH SCHOOL

20:23.958 --> 20:27.916
-[indistinct chatter]
-[Shimura] I really hope nobody's seen it.

20:35.041 --> 20:36.916
Looks like I'm in the clear.

20:43.000 --> 20:46.291
Mr. Viral Streamer! Oh, hey there!

20:46.375 --> 20:47.750
-[boy 1] Hey!
-[boy 2] Morning!

20:47.833 --> 20:49.041
It's gone viral!

20:49.125 --> 20:50.458
[Hamaken] Shimura.

20:50.541 --> 20:53.208
Why didn't you tell us
that you'd started streaming?

20:53.291 --> 20:54.166
[laughter]

20:54.250 --> 20:57.958
-Well, that was…
-Oh, come on, Hamaken. Knock it off.

20:58.041 --> 21:01.208
-Must be super embarrassing, right?
-[laughs]

21:01.291 --> 21:04.916
Isn't this really crazy though?
People overseas are watching it too.

21:05.000 --> 21:07.291
-[laughter]
-[Shimura] How did it come to this?

21:07.375 --> 21:08.666
[boy 3] Shimura!

21:11.833 --> 21:14.000
You little…

21:14.791 --> 21:18.333
[grunts] Agh! Agh!

21:18.416 --> 21:19.583
Huh?

21:20.750 --> 21:22.791
Know what? You're a puny ass.

21:23.458 --> 21:24.333
Hamaken?

21:24.416 --> 21:26.208
Don't talk to me like a friend.

21:27.583 --> 21:29.416
Hey, stop joking around.

21:29.500 --> 21:33.458
I've come up with a new idea.
It'll make your channel even greater.

21:33.541 --> 21:34.416
Not interested.

21:35.541 --> 21:38.250
How could you lose
to a piece of trash like that?

21:40.708 --> 21:42.625
Oh, don't talk like that.

21:42.708 --> 21:45.333
-Aren't we friends? You know?
-You think?

21:45.416 --> 21:46.666
[laughing]

21:46.750 --> 21:49.875
-Give me a goddamn break.
-[continues laughing] Ho ho ho!

21:49.958 --> 21:52.708
You think I'm friends
with a loser like this?

21:53.416 --> 21:55.541
-[boy 1 laughing]
-[boy 2] Whoa!

21:55.625 --> 21:57.125
[boy 4] Hell no!

21:57.208 --> 21:58.541
[all laughing]

21:59.125 --> 22:02.875
[girl 1 laughing] Oh my God,
they're perfect for each other!

22:02.958 --> 22:04.416
Shit!

22:07.125 --> 22:08.875
-[boy sobs]
-[Shimura] Are you okay?

22:08.958 --> 22:10.041
You shut up!

22:10.541 --> 22:14.166
You're the lucky one.
You've got nothing to lose.

22:15.916 --> 22:20.375
[sobs] I worked so hard
to get into Hamaken's good books.

22:21.500 --> 22:23.708
-What will you do?
-What will I do?!

22:23.791 --> 22:25.125
You asshole!

22:25.708 --> 22:28.500
I'm not going down like this. [sobs]

22:29.541 --> 22:31.208
I'm going to climb back up!

22:34.500 --> 22:35.833
What about yo?

22:36.333 --> 22:37.625
Are you okay with this?

22:38.375 --> 22:39.208
Huh?

22:39.291 --> 22:42.333
Are you okay being at the bottom
of the school's hierarchy?

22:43.916 --> 22:44.958
[mom] You are

22:45.541 --> 22:47.083
only young once.

22:47.166 --> 22:50.416
[boy] Are you okay being
everyone's laughingstock?

22:52.083 --> 22:53.750
[poignant music playing softly]

22:53.833 --> 22:55.833
Hmm. Doesn't bother me.

22:55.916 --> 22:57.500
I've come to terms with it.

22:58.416 --> 23:00.166
Come to terms with it?

23:01.750 --> 23:04.083
Besides, what can I do
to change at this point?

23:16.583 --> 23:18.458
BARBER YASHIO

23:25.750 --> 23:27.625
Whoa-ho-ho. It's freezing.

23:27.708 --> 23:29.958
[boys grunting on video]

23:37.875 --> 23:40.125
[dad] Aki, dinner's ready!

23:40.875 --> 23:41.791
[clicks]

23:46.416 --> 23:47.250
[dad] Mm.

23:49.375 --> 23:50.250
Mm.

23:50.750 --> 23:51.625
Hmm?

23:52.875 --> 23:55.791
Did something… good happen?

23:55.875 --> 23:56.916
No, not really.

23:58.375 --> 23:59.333
Okay.

24:00.875 --> 24:01.875
Mm.

24:03.291 --> 24:04.375
Mm-hmm.

24:07.833 --> 24:10.166
I'm so astonished to hear

24:10.250 --> 24:13.625
those two everyone's been talking about
are in my class at school.

24:13.708 --> 24:15.416
[astonished voices] Eh?

24:15.500 --> 24:16.875
What? Make them fight?

24:16.958 --> 24:20.041
I can't do that
because they're very good friends of mine.

24:20.125 --> 24:21.458
[boy 1] Oh, yeah, sure.

24:21.541 --> 24:23.333
You're so kind! Ha ha ha ha.

24:23.416 --> 24:26.291
Okay. Now say hi to the viewers.

24:27.000 --> 24:29.375
[students] Whoa…

24:29.458 --> 24:30.708
-Uh, hello.
-[Shimura] Hello.

24:30.791 --> 24:32.958
[both] For all of this trouble,
we're so sorry.

24:33.041 --> 24:34.958
Okay, okay, okay then. You hear that?

24:35.041 --> 24:37.166
They've patched things up
between each other now,

24:37.250 --> 24:38.750
and once again, they're best friends.

24:38.833 --> 24:41.875
So you see, you can all relax again. Hmm?

24:42.333 --> 24:45.750
So, how about this?
Today, to celebrate their reconciliation,

24:45.833 --> 24:49.166
we've decided we will be giving away
a brand-new computer

24:49.250 --> 24:52.041
to one lucky viewer out there
who subscribes and likes!

24:52.125 --> 24:54.583
It's a lie! He's lying to you!

24:54.666 --> 24:56.250
-There's no giveaways!
-[boy 2] Hey! Whoa!

24:56.333 --> 24:59.041
There's no way
that he's ever gonna give away a computer!

24:59.125 --> 25:01.750
[tense electronic music playing]

25:01.833 --> 25:03.958
You must know Hamaken is a fraud.

25:04.041 --> 25:04.958
What?

25:05.041 --> 25:07.666
All those giveaways are lies.

25:07.750 --> 25:09.958
It gets him more subscribers, you see?

25:10.041 --> 25:12.125
But he's never given anything away.

25:12.208 --> 25:14.500
Hamaken, he's a filthy fraud!

25:15.125 --> 25:18.291
He said he'd pay me 1,000 yen
for my last appearance!

25:18.375 --> 25:19.791
Let's expose him.

25:20.458 --> 25:22.083
And then everyone will know!

25:22.166 --> 25:23.833
He acts like a good guy on camera,

25:23.916 --> 25:26.750
but behind the scenes,
he beats up on everyone!

25:26.833 --> 25:30.541
-He's just a good-for-nothing delinquent!
-What the hell are you saying?

25:30.625 --> 25:33.833
Have a look at this!
Hamaken did this to me!

25:38.500 --> 25:39.333
Ha!

25:39.416 --> 25:43.541
[forced laughter]

25:43.625 --> 25:45.250
You idiot.

25:45.750 --> 25:48.083
We stopped streaming a while ago.

25:52.041 --> 25:54.750
So who were you calling a fraud?

25:54.833 --> 25:56.375
[yelps]

25:56.458 --> 25:57.541
[boy 3] Whoa!

25:57.625 --> 25:58.500
[Hamaken] Look.

25:59.416 --> 26:01.500
-[Shimura gasping]
-[Hamaken grunting]

26:01.583 --> 26:02.708
[students murmuring]

26:02.791 --> 26:04.125
-[grunts]
-[students yell]

26:05.208 --> 26:06.041
[groaning] Agh!

26:06.125 --> 26:08.208
[boy 4] Hamaken! Hamaken!
Let's go! Go! Let's go!

26:08.291 --> 26:10.791
-[students chattering]
-[girl 1] Oh, man. Hamaken's pissed.

26:11.666 --> 26:13.166
Were you trying to expose me?

26:13.250 --> 26:15.416
-Were you trying to take revenge?
-[Shimura groaning]

26:15.500 --> 26:17.291
-[grunts] Ah!
-[students gasp]

26:17.791 --> 26:20.375
-[grunts] Ah! Ah!
-[students gasping]

26:20.458 --> 26:22.083
-[kick thuds]
-[Hamaken grunts] Ah!

26:22.833 --> 26:24.666
-[Hamaken grunting] Ah! Ah!
-[whimpering]

26:25.916 --> 26:26.916
[Shimura] Expose him?

26:27.541 --> 26:28.458
On his channel?

26:28.541 --> 26:32.250
-No. No. We do it on our channel.
-Huh?

26:32.333 --> 26:34.666
Right now,
you and I are minor celebrities.

26:34.750 --> 26:36.791
This exposé video will go viral.

26:36.875 --> 26:39.958
[dramatic music playing]

26:40.041 --> 26:40.875
No!

26:40.958 --> 26:43.333
-If I do that, he'll beat me up again.
-Money.

26:45.541 --> 26:46.958
Don't you want money?

26:49.541 --> 26:52.500
[sighs] I guess I have no other choice.

26:54.416 --> 26:57.041
If we succeed in exposing him,

26:57.125 --> 26:58.833
I'll give you 10,000 yen.

26:58.916 --> 27:00.583
[Hamaken kicks] Get up! You hear me?

27:00.666 --> 27:02.166
I said get up!

27:02.250 --> 27:03.708
[boy 1] Hey, wanna go see Hamaken?

27:03.791 --> 27:06.125
[girl 1] Who picked a fight?
This is crazy!

27:06.208 --> 27:08.875
[girl 2] Who'd pick a fight with Hamaken?
Are they insane?

27:08.958 --> 27:10.958
-[Hamaken roars]
-[girls shriek]

27:11.041 --> 27:12.208
[Shimura groans]

27:12.291 --> 27:14.833
[gasping, sobbing]

27:14.916 --> 27:17.333
Don't you ever mess
with me again, you hear?

27:17.416 --> 27:19.416
[Shimura crying]

27:20.875 --> 27:23.208
-[dramatic music playing]
-[Hamaken] Huh?

27:24.500 --> 27:25.625
Money.

27:27.750 --> 27:30.750
You owe me… 1,000 yen.

27:31.583 --> 27:32.708
What the hell's up with you?

27:33.458 --> 27:34.333
[boy 2 laughs]

27:34.416 --> 27:35.500
[Hamaken] Hmm?

27:36.041 --> 27:38.708
You want me to beat you to a pulp? Do you?

27:39.291 --> 27:42.125
Fine by me, you piece of shit.

27:42.708 --> 27:44.666
[boy 3] Who's causing the ruckus?

27:54.208 --> 27:55.041
Is it you?

27:56.166 --> 27:57.041
No.

27:57.666 --> 27:59.083
Will you keep it down?

27:59.166 --> 28:00.000
I can't nap.

28:01.666 --> 28:03.250
Oh. All right.

28:08.291 --> 28:10.833
[students murmuring]

28:12.458 --> 28:13.291
Hey.

28:14.833 --> 28:15.708
Hey!

28:24.291 --> 28:25.958
[groans] It hurts.

28:27.083 --> 28:28.541
Hey, you're alive.

28:30.041 --> 28:32.125
Uh, how did I get here?

28:32.208 --> 28:34.000
It was Ogi from the class next door.

28:35.916 --> 28:37.166
Ogi?

28:39.250 --> 28:41.208
[boy] Ogi Tatsuya.

28:41.291 --> 28:44.791
A man who exists
outside of the school's social ladder.

28:44.875 --> 28:48.791
A high schooler and rising star
in the world of MMA fighting.

28:48.875 --> 28:52.333
So, what happened? The exposé video?

28:54.791 --> 28:56.708
[Hamaken on video] You trying
to take revenge?

28:56.791 --> 28:59.000
-[Hamaken grunts] Ah!
-[students gasp]

28:59.083 --> 29:00.041
[Hamaken grunts] Ah!

29:02.125 --> 29:03.625
It's gone viral!

29:03.708 --> 29:06.166
Yeah. It was a success!

29:06.250 --> 29:07.583
Yes! You owe me 10,000--

29:07.666 --> 29:09.208
Sorry. I can't give it to you.

29:09.291 --> 29:11.916
Huh? Why not? We made a deal.

29:12.000 --> 29:14.875
You didn't last long enough.
That's your problem.

29:14.958 --> 29:15.916
What?

29:16.000 --> 29:19.125
Short videos, you see,
they don't make enough money.

29:19.208 --> 29:21.333
There's just not enough ad revenue.

29:21.750 --> 29:25.125
That's why we've gotta go after donations.

29:25.833 --> 29:26.875
Donations.

29:26.958 --> 29:30.541
Even with donations,
long videos still rake in more money.

29:30.625 --> 29:33.666
And even long videos,
you still don't get the full amount.

29:33.750 --> 29:37.458
After all the fees,
there's still only about 60 percent left.

29:37.541 --> 29:40.041
In this case,

29:40.125 --> 29:41.208
3,900.

29:41.291 --> 29:43.625
3,900?! After all that effort?

29:43.708 --> 29:45.791
That's what happens
when the video's short.

29:45.875 --> 29:48.291
And it doesn't help
that we don't have many followers yet.

29:48.375 --> 29:50.166
I had no idea.

29:53.000 --> 29:54.458
Hey. Hold on a sec.

29:54.541 --> 29:57.250
None of this is any of my problem.
You should pay what you promised--

29:57.333 --> 29:58.708
Okay, right now

29:59.375 --> 30:02.541
I'm asking if you're happy settling
for a measly 10,000.

30:04.125 --> 30:06.708
This video has already reached
one million views.

30:06.791 --> 30:08.708
As the views increase,
so will the followers.

30:08.791 --> 30:12.916
If we can stream for longer,
making millions won't be a dream!

30:17.875 --> 30:19.083
Did you know

30:19.583 --> 30:23.333
that sometimes from a single stream
you can make over 200 million?

30:23.416 --> 30:25.833
-200?!
-Million!

30:26.375 --> 30:27.916
200 million.

30:28.000 --> 30:29.458
It's up to you.

30:32.166 --> 30:33.041
Hey.

30:35.458 --> 30:36.291
Hey, Shimura?

30:38.250 --> 30:39.458
Did you get any of that?

30:39.541 --> 30:41.833
Oh. Uh, sorry.

30:42.583 --> 30:44.541
What's wrong with you? Little creep.

30:47.375 --> 30:51.541
So, if... if we did a live stream,
what would we do?

30:55.583 --> 30:57.500
[militant rock music playing]

30:57.583 --> 30:58.875
Fights?

30:58.958 --> 31:02.916
-Yeah. Our main content will be fighting.
-Wait a minute.

31:03.000 --> 31:05.041
Picking fights
with delinquents in real time.

31:05.125 --> 31:06.333
But videos of fights are--

31:06.416 --> 31:09.291
It's about the idea.
Striking gold isn't easy.

31:09.375 --> 31:10.375
You have a point, but…

31:10.458 --> 31:12.708
I'm convinced by our recent success.

31:12.791 --> 31:16.500
It went viral because the underdog
picked a fight with a bully

31:17.000 --> 31:18.041
[Shimura] You owe me

31:18.958 --> 31:20.583
1,000 yen.

31:24.625 --> 31:26.041
Let's team up.

31:26.791 --> 31:30.083
-Huh?
-Starting today, I'm your producer, okay?

31:30.166 --> 31:33.250
With our next video,
we'll rake in the donations.

31:34.375 --> 31:37.291
Let's take over the world
with this channel.

31:37.375 --> 31:39.375
[rock music continues]

31:41.708 --> 31:42.833
[grunts]

31:43.500 --> 31:45.708
I'll have you rolling in cash.

31:50.083 --> 31:51.083
Rolling in cash?

31:55.375 --> 31:56.500
So we're set.

31:57.208 --> 32:01.125
I need you to be able to drag out a fight
and make it last no matter what.

32:10.791 --> 32:13.458
-[camera clicking]
-[giggles]

32:14.041 --> 32:16.083
So good. Totally insta-worthy.

32:16.166 --> 32:19.333
-[Hamaken groaning]
-How much longer are you going to take?

32:19.416 --> 32:20.750
-[Rumi] Oh.
-[camera clicking]

32:21.250 --> 32:25.708
Oh… but… Hey. Hey.

32:26.750 --> 32:29.166
You take our time.

32:29.250 --> 32:33.041
Can't we get on with it?
Baby, don't drag it out.

32:33.541 --> 32:34.375
[Yumi] Huh?

32:36.583 --> 32:37.708
What this?

32:38.666 --> 32:40.083
[grunting on video]

32:41.541 --> 32:43.708
-[snarling]
-[Hamaken on video] Get up.

32:43.791 --> 32:45.916
Those shitheads! God damn!

32:46.000 --> 32:48.583
POPULAR STREAMER HAMAKEN
IS A TEENAGE DELINQUENT!

32:51.625 --> 32:53.875
[grunting and thudding on video]

32:55.750 --> 32:58.416
How to last in a fight, huh?

32:59.000 --> 32:59.875
[gasps]

33:00.875 --> 33:02.500
[grunting on video continues]

33:04.375 --> 33:05.333
[mouse clicks]

33:06.458 --> 33:07.625
[funky music playing]

33:07.708 --> 33:09.958
HOW TO FIGHT BETTER

33:12.750 --> 33:15.791
STRENGTH TRAINING
TO IMPROVE FIGHTING

33:16.875 --> 33:17.750
[clicking]

33:17.833 --> 33:19.500
GET STRONGER
WITH MARTIAL ARTS

33:19.583 --> 33:20.875
I should've expected this.

33:20.958 --> 33:22.000
JOIN A MARTIAL ARTS GYM

33:22.083 --> 33:23.916
BOXING VIDEO

33:24.000 --> 33:24.875
[mouse clicks]

33:30.083 --> 33:33.666
I think I'd die… if I did this.

33:33.750 --> 33:35.250
[man on video] Yeah, that's it.

33:35.333 --> 33:38.125
-[Hamaken yelling indistinctly on video]
-I'm not cut out for this.

33:38.625 --> 33:41.583
Besides, why am I the one
who has to get beaten?

33:41.666 --> 33:43.375
This is so crazy.

33:45.458 --> 33:46.875
YOU'RE BRAVE, SHIMURA

33:49.250 --> 33:52.375
"How_to_fight"? Mm.

33:53.250 --> 33:54.458
-What's this?
-[clicks]

33:59.416 --> 34:00.708
Zero.

34:00.791 --> 34:02.708
Doesn't have any views?

34:15.375 --> 34:17.375
FIGHTING MINDSET
0 VIEWS

34:22.750 --> 34:24.250
[clicking]

34:33.708 --> 34:35.708
[ominous music playing]

34:44.416 --> 34:46.416
[dramatic percussive sounds echoing]

34:48.416 --> 34:49.375
TOU-KEI

34:53.750 --> 34:57.833
Hello guys. My name is TOU-KEI.

34:57.916 --> 35:00.458
Why don't you come
and get stronger with me?

35:00.541 --> 35:02.916
-Why is he a chicken?
-[jaunty pop music playing]

35:03.000 --> 35:05.125
Want to know how to get stronger?

35:05.208 --> 35:07.250
It's really very easy.

35:07.333 --> 35:09.750
Just become my friend.
That's all you need to do.

35:09.833 --> 35:11.208
Is he not Japanese?

35:11.291 --> 35:15.666
I can teach you how to become strong,
everything you need to know step-by-step.

35:16.666 --> 35:20.208
Did you know when it comes
to winning a fight, there's a secret?

35:20.291 --> 35:21.166
Huh?

35:21.250 --> 35:25.750
And if you're interested,
I can teach you what that secret is.

35:25.833 --> 35:27.125
-But first…
-Seriously?

35:27.208 --> 35:29.833
…let's talk about the fighting mindset.

35:29.916 --> 35:32.083
-Now, step one…
-[mouse clicks]

35:35.166 --> 35:38.000
I think this guy is nuts.

35:39.291 --> 35:41.208
I can't do this.

35:41.875 --> 35:43.791
Hello there. I'm Hamaken.

35:43.875 --> 35:48.000
Today, I'm gonna ask girls enjoying
the nightlife about their dark past.

35:48.833 --> 35:50.666
Hey, ladies. Ladies. Hey, ladies.

35:50.750 --> 35:52.708
Can you tell me about things
in your dark past?

35:52.791 --> 35:54.958
-Hamaken, ew!
-You've got to be kidding me!

35:55.041 --> 35:56.708
Don't be like that.
Tell me something saucy!

35:56.791 --> 35:57.791
HOW'S THE BACKLASH?
THE AUDACITY!

35:57.875 --> 36:00.333
-Don't film us without permission!
-Creepy loser!

36:00.416 --> 36:02.416
[din of music and chattering]

36:06.250 --> 36:08.333
-[dance music playing]
-[Hamaken] Not feeling it today.

36:08.416 --> 36:09.708
Time for a break.

36:12.041 --> 36:13.291
Hey! No high schoolers allowed.

36:13.375 --> 36:14.500
What? You always let me in.

36:14.583 --> 36:17.750
-No.
-Hey! Let go of me! Let go! Hey!

36:17.833 --> 36:19.708
I want to see the manager. Hey!

36:19.791 --> 36:21.375
Hey! Rumi!

36:21.458 --> 36:23.250
-Good work.
-Hey, Rumi!

36:23.333 --> 36:25.583
Hey! Hey! Take your hands off me!

36:25.666 --> 36:27.291
Let me go! Let go!

36:28.375 --> 36:29.291
[music stops]

36:36.083 --> 36:37.208
[sighs]

36:43.541 --> 36:47.166
[Hamaken] You've got to ask yourself,
is your mother still alive? Is she?

36:47.250 --> 36:48.500
[tense music playing]

36:48.583 --> 36:51.625
I suggested it to your mother,
but she declined.

36:53.583 --> 36:56.041
I'll have you rolling in cash.

36:59.916 --> 37:00.833
[music ends]

37:00.916 --> 37:02.583
[screams]

37:02.666 --> 37:05.083
[TOU-KEI] Don't you get lonely
being by yourself?

37:05.166 --> 37:08.208
-Why are you here?!
-Don't you want to become stronger?

37:08.708 --> 37:12.000
If you'll be my friend,
then you can get stronger with me.

37:12.083 --> 37:13.083
What the hell?

37:13.166 --> 37:15.875
[TOU-KEI] Become stronger,
and you can change your world!

37:15.958 --> 37:18.375
Get lost! Go! [grunts]

37:19.458 --> 37:21.500
[gasping]

37:22.625 --> 37:25.500
[gasping]

37:28.666 --> 37:30.250
-[thud on video]
-[Hamaken on video] Huh?

37:31.375 --> 37:32.708
[Shimura] Money.

37:34.208 --> 37:37.833
You owe me… 1,000 yen.

37:39.250 --> 37:40.791
[Hamaken] What the hell's up with you?

37:41.916 --> 37:44.375
You want me
to beat you to a pulp, do you?

37:45.583 --> 37:48.750
Fine by me, you piece of shit.

37:53.500 --> 37:55.500
[students chattering indistinctly]

38:15.375 --> 38:16.708
Hey! Get outta my way!

38:18.875 --> 38:20.916
Oh, Shimura! This is bad.  Really bad.

38:21.000 --> 38:21.916
-[roars]
-Oh, yeah!

38:22.000 --> 38:22.833
Hey!

38:22.916 --> 38:25.541
-Come with me! Hurry!
-[boy 1] And him too!

38:25.625 --> 38:27.666
[gasping] Let's go that way.

38:27.750 --> 38:30.208
[Hamaken roars] Ah!
Where the hell do you think you're going?

38:30.291 --> 38:31.291
[barks] Ah!

38:31.375 --> 38:34.291
-[Shimura whimpering]
-You're dead! You're fucking dead!

38:34.375 --> 38:37.875
[Shimura yelling, screaming]

38:37.958 --> 38:38.791
[boy 1] Move it!

38:38.875 --> 38:41.041
-[boy 3] Hey! Hey!  It's a fight!
-[boy 4] Huh?

38:41.125 --> 38:44.500
-Who's fighting?
-[boy 3] Hamaken. He's super pissed!

38:46.458 --> 38:48.625
-[Hamaken grunting] Agh! Agh!
-[Shimura gasping]

38:48.708 --> 38:50.791
-[Shimura grunting]
-[girls shriek]

38:52.791 --> 38:54.708
[boy 1] I say it was an accident.

38:54.791 --> 38:55.666
[laughing]

38:55.750 --> 38:58.166
-You think you're so tough? Huh?!
-Whoa-ho-ho!

38:58.250 --> 39:00.208
-But you're not. So take this!
-[Shimura grunting]

39:00.291 --> 39:01.583
[boys] Whoa-ho!

39:01.666 --> 39:03.708
-[boys laughing]
-[Hamaken] There, now!

39:03.791 --> 39:06.333
Die! Die! You little shit!

39:07.041 --> 39:09.916
You! Bastard! You bastard!
You're gonna die!

39:10.000 --> 39:11.583
[boy 4] Stop it, Hamaken!

39:11.666 --> 39:13.791
[tense rock music playing]

39:14.625 --> 39:16.666
Everyone's going to see this.

39:17.625 --> 39:19.791
You think so? I doubt that.

39:19.875 --> 39:20.875
Huh?

39:20.958 --> 39:21.875
Oh, yeah!

39:21.958 --> 39:25.250
[boys grunting]

39:26.416 --> 39:27.583
[boy 4 groaning]

39:32.875 --> 39:34.625
-[grunting]
-[boys laughing]

39:34.708 --> 39:37.375
I'll make sure you never defy me again.

39:37.458 --> 39:38.458
You hear me? Huh?!

39:38.541 --> 39:41.041
-[girls scream]
-[boy 2] Hey! Don't run away!

39:41.125 --> 39:42.791
-Don't run away! Hey!
-[Shimura] Agh!

39:42.875 --> 39:45.958
[Hamaken snarls] You are a piece of trash!

39:46.041 --> 39:47.375
-[Shimura groans]
-[Hamaken] Yeah!

39:47.458 --> 39:49.291
-This is just for starters!
-[boy 1] Hey.  Hey!

39:49.375 --> 39:51.083
[boy 2] Uh-uh! No running away!

39:51.166 --> 39:54.958
-You're nothing but a lowlife!
-[students scream]

39:56.000 --> 39:57.875
[gasping for air]

39:58.500 --> 40:00.750
[Hamaken] Where do you think you're going?

40:00.833 --> 40:04.875
You deserve to spend the rest of your life
crawling on the ground!

40:05.833 --> 40:08.708
[gasping, straining]

40:08.791 --> 40:10.791
[tense music playing]

40:12.750 --> 40:14.041
[Shimura shudders]

40:14.666 --> 40:17.291
[boy 4] Stop it. Don't look over here.

40:19.708 --> 40:21.750
Hey, stop looking at me.

40:27.541 --> 40:29.000
I've got you on camera.

40:34.708 --> 40:35.708
[whispers] Let's go.

40:37.833 --> 40:39.208
Give me your phone!

40:39.291 --> 40:40.375
Huh? What for?

40:40.458 --> 40:41.458
Are you stupid?

40:41.541 --> 40:43.666
We've really got to get smart about this.

40:43.750 --> 40:46.000
Now listen very carefully.

40:46.500 --> 40:48.750
They're going to take
my phone away from me.

40:48.833 --> 40:49.916
-Huh?
-So let's get smart!

40:50.000 --> 40:51.750
Hang on. I don't understand. What is--

40:51.833 --> 40:53.583
I'm saying this is our chance.

40:54.458 --> 40:55.583
Our chance?

40:56.500 --> 40:58.583
Yeah. To make a killing.

41:03.833 --> 41:04.750
Hey.

41:04.833 --> 41:07.458
You keep your head down now, you hear me?

41:09.833 --> 41:10.666
[huffs]

41:10.750 --> 41:13.500
[footsteps departing]

41:16.250 --> 41:18.625
[straining, gasping]

41:20.791 --> 41:22.833
[tense music swells]

41:22.916 --> 41:23.875
[groans]

41:23.958 --> 41:26.583
[Shimura] Being on top
never really mattered to me.

41:31.166 --> 41:32.375
All I need…

41:33.625 --> 41:34.791
is money.

41:35.291 --> 41:36.666
[Shimura gasping]

41:38.541 --> 41:40.750
The underdog bites back at the bully.

41:42.041 --> 41:44.416
That's what's gonna make us rich, right?

41:49.916 --> 41:51.958
[shuddering]

41:52.041 --> 41:54.416
[breathing deeply]

41:59.083 --> 42:00.041
VIEWS: 1

42:04.375 --> 42:06.375
[tense music intensifying]

42:27.625 --> 42:29.708
Go on. Come at me.

42:30.375 --> 42:32.333
You piece of shit.

42:35.291 --> 42:37.958
[rock music in Japanese playing]

42:47.125 --> 42:53.375
VIRAL HIT

42:59.333 --> 43:01.375
[rock music in Japanese continues]

44:10.791 --> 44:11.750
[music ends]
